div>I confirm that I am a <strong>UK</strong> resident.</div>\n      </li>\n   </ul>\n   <div class=\"aga-disc-table\">\n      <p class=\"terms-condition\">\n         All premiums shown include Insurance Premium Tax at the current rate. You may cancel this insurance within 14 days of purchase. This insurance is for UK residents who are <strong>70 years old or under</strong>. If you choose to purchase Virgin Atlantic Travel Insurance at a later date, prices may differ.\n      </p>\n      <p class=\"terms-condition mt-2\">\n          <b>Virgin Atlantic Limited is an Appointed Representative of AWP Assistance UK Limited which is authorised and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority (FCA).  AWP Assistance UK Limited FCA registration number is 311909. FCA authorisation can be checked on the FCA register at <a href=\"https://register.fca.org.uk/s\" target=\"_blank\">https://register.fca.org.uk/s/</a></b>\n       </p>\n   </div>\n</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
